    "body": "Quick pass: good. Head `07082e0` merges cleanly with `main`. The body is complete. The diff has 2 files: the Picomax machine file and its tests.\n\nOn this head the touched binaries are green: `machine_controller`, `machine`, `machine_library`, `posting`, `klartext_builtin`, `conformance` and the `example_catalog` suites. `script_heidenhain_klartext` and clippy of `camcraft-app` are also green. No Picomax golden changed, so the posted output stays the same.\n\nThe axis travel follows the convention of the other shipped machine files: a stroke L is written `-L..L` from the work origin. The new travel limits change which programs this machine refuses. For this reason I leave the merge to the maintainer. I flag the PR ready for review.\n",
